; The debug menu's equipment sets (dead_air_x64_debug_menu.script, tab "loadouts"; docs/dead-air/DEBUG_MENU.md).
; A set: name (a string id or text), items (sections, "section:count"; ammo counts boxes), ammo_boxes (boxes of the first
; ammo of each weapon the set gives no ammo for). The player's own sets and edits live in
; <appdata>\dead_air_x64_loadouts.ltx in the same form, a set of the same id there taking this one's place. An outfit
; that carries its own helmet (helmet_avaliable = false) takes none, and a SEVA takes a backpack only as its *_backpack
; variant.

